{"page":500,"verses":[{"verse_key":"45:14","surah":45,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"قُل لِّلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ يَغْفِرُوا۟ لِلَّذِينَ لَا يَرْجُونَ أَيَّامَ ٱللَّهِ لِيَجْزِىَ قَوْمًۢا بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَكْسِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Tell the believers to forgive those who do not fear God’s days [of punishment]––He will requite people for what they have done.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُل","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِّلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"to those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَغْفِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"(to) forgive","transliteration":"yaghfirū","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَرْجُونَ","en_gloss":"hope","transliteration":"yarjūna","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَيَّامَ","en_gloss":"(for the) days","transliteration":"ayyāma","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِيَجْزِىَ","en_gloss":"that He may recompense","transliteration":"liyajziya","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَوْمًۢا","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawman","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَكْسِبُونَ","en_gloss":"earn","transliteration":"yaksibūna","verse_key":"45:14"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٤","en_gloss":"(14)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"45:14"}]},{"verse_key":"45:15","surah":45,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"مَنْ عَمِلَ صَـٰلِحًا فَلِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ وَمَنْ أَسَآءَ فَعَلَيْهَا ۖ ثُمَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكُمْ تُرْجَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whoever does good benefits himself, and whoever does evil harms himself: you will all be returned to your Lord.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَنْ","en_gloss":"Whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"45:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَمِلَ","en_gloss":"does","transliteration":"ʿamila","verse_key":"45:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","en_gloss":"a righteous deed","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","verse_key":"45:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَلِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"then it is for his soul","transliteration":"falinafsihi","verse_key":"45:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"45:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَسَآءَ","en_gloss":"does evil","transliteration":"asāa","verse_key":"45:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَعَلَيْهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"then it (is) against it","transliteration":"faʿalayhā","verse_key":"45:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"45:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"45:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَبِّكُمْ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbikum","verse_key":"45:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تُرْجَعُونَ","en_gloss":"you will be returned","transliteration":"tur'jaʿūna","verse_key":"45:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٥","en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"45:15"}]},{"verse_key":"45:16","surah":45,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ ءَاتَيْنَا بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ وَٱلْحُكْمَ وَٱلنُّبُوَّةَ وَرَزَقْنَـٰهُم مِّنَ ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ وَفَضَّلْنَـٰهُمْ عَلَى ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We gave scripture, wisdom, and prophethood to the Children of Israel; We provided them with good things and favoured them above others;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَا","en_gloss":"We gave","transliteration":"ātaynā","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"(the) Children of Israel","transliteration":"banī","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","en_gloss":"(the) Children of Israel","transliteration":"is'rāīla","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْحُكْمَ","en_gloss":"and the wisdom","transliteration":"wal-ḥuk'ma","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلنُّبُوَّةَ","en_gloss":"and the Prophethood","transliteration":"wal-nubuwata","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَرَزَقْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"and We provided them","transliteration":"warazaqnāhum","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the good things","transliteration":"l-ṭayibāti","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَفَضَّلْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"and We preferred them","transliteration":"wafaḍḍalnāhum","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_gloss":"the worlds","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","verse_key":"45:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"45:16"}]},{"verse_key":"45:17","surah":45,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُم بَيِّنَـٰتٍ مِّنَ ٱلْأَمْرِ ۖ فَمَا ٱخْتَلَفُوٓا۟ إِلَّا مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا جَآءَهُمُ ٱلْعِلْمُ بَغْيًۢا بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ يَقْضِى بَيْنَهُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ فِيمَا كَانُوا۟ فِيهِ يَخْتَلِفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We gave them clear proof in matters [of religion]. They differed among themselves out of mutual rivalry, only after knowledge came to them: on the Day of Resurrection your Lord will judge between them regarding their differences.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"And We gave them","transliteration":"waātaynāhum","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَيِّنَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"clear proofs","transliteration":"bayyinātin","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the matter","transliteration":"l-amri","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱخْتَلَفُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they differed","transliteration":"ikh'talafū","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"[what]","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"جَآءَهُمُ","en_gloss":"came to them","transliteration":"jāahumu","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْعِلْمُ","en_gloss":"the knowledge","transliteration":"l-ʿil'mu","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَغْيًۢا","en_gloss":"(out of) envy","transliteration":"baghyan","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"between themselves","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":16,"ar":"رَبَّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbaka","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يَقْضِى","en_gloss":"will judge","transliteration":"yaqḍī","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":18,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمْ","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":21,"ar":"فِيمَا","en_gloss":"about what","transliteration":"fīmā","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":22,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":23,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":24,"ar":"يَخْتَلِفُونَ","en_gloss":"differ","transliteration":"yakhtalifūna","verse_key":"45:17"},{"pos":25,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"45:17"}]},{"verse_key":"45:18","surah":45,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ جَعَلْنَـٰكَ عَلَىٰ شَرِيعَةٍ مِّنَ ٱلْأَمْرِ فَٱتَّبِعْهَا وَلَا تَتَّبِعْ أَهْوَآءَ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Now We have set you [Muhammad] on a clear religious path, so follow it. Do not follow the desires of those who lack [true] knowledge-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَعَلْنَـٰكَ","en_gloss":"We put you","transliteration":"jaʿalnāka","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"شَرِيعَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"an ordained way","transliteration":"sharīʿatin","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرِ","en_gloss":"the matter","transliteration":"l-amri","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَٱتَّبِعْهَا","en_gloss":"so follow it","transliteration":"fa-ittabiʿ'hā","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَتَّبِعْ","en_gloss":"follow","transliteration":"tattabiʿ","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَهْوَآءَ","en_gloss":"(the) desires","transliteration":"ahwāa","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"45:18"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"45:18"}]},{"verse_key":"45:19","surah":45,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ لَن يُغْنُوا۟ عَنكَ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ شَيْـًٔا ۚ وَإِنَّ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ بَعْضُهُمْ أَوْلِيَآءُ بَعْضٍ ۖ وَٱللَّهُ وَلِىُّ ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they cannot help you against God in any way. Wrongdoers only have each other to protect them; the righteous have God Himself as their protector.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"Indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَن","en_gloss":"never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُغْنُوا۟","en_gloss":"will avail","transliteration":"yugh'nū","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَنكَ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"ʿanka","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا ۚ","en_gloss":"(in) anything","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"the wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بَعْضُهُمْ","en_gloss":"some of them","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءُ","en_gloss":"(are) allies","transliteration":"awliyāu","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَعْضٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) others","transliteration":"baʿḍin","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"and Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلِىُّ","en_gloss":"(is the) Protector","transliteration":"waliyyu","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the righteous","transliteration":"l-mutaqīna","verse_key":"45:19"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"45:19"}]},{"verse_key":"45:20","surah":45,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا بَصَـٰٓئِرُ لِلنَّاسِ وَهُدًى وَرَحْمَةٌ لِّقَوْمٍ يُوقِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This [revelation] is a means of insight for people, a source of guidance and mercy for those of sure faith.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"45:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَصَـٰٓئِرُ","en_gloss":"(is) enlightenment","transliteration":"baṣāiru","verse_key":"45:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"for mankind","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","verse_key":"45:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَهُدًۭى","en_gloss":"and guidance","transliteration":"wahudan","verse_key":"45:20"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَرَحْمَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"and mercy","transliteration":"waraḥmatun","verse_key":"45:20"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a people","transliteration":"liqawmin","verse_key":"45:20"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُوقِنُونَ","en_gloss":"who are certain","transliteration":"yūqinūna","verse_key":"45:20"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٢٠","en_gloss":"(20)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"45:20"}]},{"verse_key":"45:21","surah":45,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ حَسِبَ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱجْتَرَحُوا۟ ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ أَن نَّجْعَلَهُمْ كَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ سَوَآءً مَّحْيَاهُمْ وَمَمَاتُهُمْ ۚ سَآءَ مَا يَحْكُمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do those who commit evil deeds really think that We will deal with them in the same way as those who believe and do righteous deeds, that they will be alike in their living and their dying? How badly they judge!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Do","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"45:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"حَسِبَ","en_gloss":"think","transliteration":"ḥasiba","verse_key":"45:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"45:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱجْتَرَحُوا۟","en_gloss":"commit","transliteration":"ij'taraḥū","verse_key":"45:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ","en_gloss":"evil deeds","transliteration":"l-sayiāti","verse_key":"45:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"45:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نَّجْعَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"We will make them","transliteration":"na